        "text": "Hi, before we start: this call is being transcribed for my records."
      },
      {
        "turn_id": "call-1#3",
        "media_id": "call-1",
        "second": 12.8,
        "speaker": "insurer_rep",
        "end_s": 19.0,
        "text": "That's fine. This is Denise in member services. Who am I speaking with?"
      },
      {
        "turn_id": "call-1#4",
        "media_id": "call-1",
        "second": 19.5,
        "speaker": "caregiver",
        "end_s": 31.0,
        "text": "Maya Calloway. I'm the appointed representative for my mother, Ruth Calloway, member FW-208-3341."
      },
      {
        "turn_id": "call-1#5",
        "media_id": "call-1",
        "second": 31.5,
        "speaker": "insurer_rep",
        "end_s": 44.0,
        "text": "Thank you. I see your representative form on file for Ruth, received October 8. How can I help?"
      },
      {
        "turn_id": "call-1#6",
        "media_id": "call-1",
        "second": 44.5,
        "speaker": "caregiver",
        "end_s": 55.0,
        "text": "Her skilled nursing stay at Brookhollow was denied, denial DN-6104. Why?"
      },
      {
        "turn_id": "call-1#7",
        "media_id": "call-1",
        "second": 55.5,
        "speaker": "insurer_rep",
        "end_s": 72.0,
        "text": "The October 2 notice says the stay was not medically necessary. The reviewer noted no physician's note on the case."
      },
      {
        "turn_id": "call-1#8",
        "media_id": "call-1",
        "second": 72.5,
        "speaker": "caregiver",
        "end_s": 86.0,
        "text": "Dr. Okonkwo faxed his note on September 29. Is it really not there?"
      },
      {
        "turn_id": "call-1#9",
        "media_id": "call-1",
